Gruvbox color values, as published in the Tinted Theming schemes
(https://github.com/tinted-theming/schemes, tag spec-0.11, base16/gruvbox-*.yaml).

Those schemes credit the palette to "Dawid Kurek (dawikur@gmail.com), morhetz
(https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox)". WSurf takes the values from the Tinted
Theming schemes, which are MIT-licensed; no separate notice from the original
Gruvbox author is published there or claimed here.

